      "widgets_values": [
        "A photorealistic, professional studio portrait of a stunning 24-year-old Caucasian/Slavic female influencer. She is dressed in highly detailed and sexy Final Fantasy-inspired battle gear, showcasing an hourglass figure and toned physique. The lighting is dramatic and cinematic, emphasizing her high cheekbones, defined jawline, and prominent brow bone. Her face is heart-shaped/oval, framed by long, straight, shiny black hair. Her almond-shaped, upturned light brown eyes are accentuated with dark eyeliner, and her full lips are adorned with pink lipstick and a defined cupid's bow. She confidently poses with a knuckle iron, adding an edge to her powerful and alluring presence. The background is a blurred, dark studio setting, allowing the focus to remain entirely on the subject. 8k resolution, highly detailed skin texture, sharp focus, [style].\n"
