        "realistic, sexy, sensual, seductive, . Medium shot, at shoulder height, of a photorealistic 24-year-old Caucasian/Slavic female influencer standing in a fighting stance on a cobblestone street in a medieval fantasy village town square. She is dressed in highly detailed and sexy Final Fantasy-inspired battle gear, showcasing an hourglass figure and toned physique, knuckles adorned with a knuckle iron. The scene is bathed in dramatic, cinematic lighting, emphasizing her high cheekbones, defined jawline, and prominent brow bone. Her face is heart-shaped/oval, framed by long, straight, shiny black hair. Her almond-shaped, upturned light brown eyes are accentuated with dark eyeliner, and her full lips are adorned with pink lipstick and a defined cupid's bow. In the blurred background, indistinct figures of villagers are engaged in their daily routines, rendered with motion blur to convey the bustling energy of the marketplace. The overall atmosphere is of adventure and impending conflict. 8k resolution, highly detailed skin texture, sharp focus, fantasy art style.\n"
